pt;\">: </span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">학생들의 자발적이고 체계적인 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt;\">‘</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">지역인재 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt;\">7</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">급 수습직원 선발</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt;\">’ </span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">준비를 돕고 우수 인재가 사회에 기여할 수 있도록 특정분야대비동아리</span></p><p class=\"0\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;[</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">지역인재 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt;\">7</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">급 선발 대비반</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt;\">]</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">을 운영</span></p><p class=\"0\">  <!--[if !supportEmptyParas]-->&nbsp;</p><p class=\"0\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt;\">2) </span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">내용</span></p><p class=\"0\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">-</span><span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;\">특정분야대비동아리인 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">[</span><span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;\">지역인재 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">7</span><span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;\">급 선발 대비반</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">]</span><span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;\">운영에 필요한 활동비 및 행정적 지원</span></p><p class=\"0\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">-</span><span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;\">특정분야대비동아리 활동을 통하여 체계적인 준비를 유도하여 취업 희망분야의 경쟁력을 강화</span></p><p class=\"0\">  <!--[if !supportEmptyParas]-->&nbsp;<!--[endif]-->  <o:p></o:p></p><p class=\"0\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">3) </span><span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;\">모집인원 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">: </span><span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;\">본교 재학생 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">5</span><span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;\">명 이상 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">10</span><span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;\">명 미만으로 구성 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">(</span><span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;\">휴학생 및 졸업생 불가</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">)</span></p><p class=\"0\">  <!--[if !supportEmptyParas]-->&nbsp;<!--[endif]-->  <o:p></o:p></p><p class=\"0\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">4) </span><span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;\">지원자격</span></p><p class=\"0\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">-</span><span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;\">본교 재학생 중 지역인재 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">7</span><span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;\">급 선발에 대한 뚜렷한 목적성과 계획이 있는 자</span></p><p class=\"0\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">-</span><span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;\">학과성적이 상위 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">10% </span><span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;\">이내인자</span></p><p class=\"0\"><span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">※ </span><span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;\">지원자의 성적은 학생성공처 취업지원팀에서 일괄 확인하여 적합성 여부 판단</span></p><p class=\"0\">  <!--[if !supportEmptyParas]-->&nbsp;<!--[endif]-->  <o:p></o:p></p><p class=\"0\"><b><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; color: rgb(9, 0, 255);\">5) </span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; color: rgb(9, 0, 255);\">신청기간 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; color: rgb(9, 0, 255);\">: 2022.03.16(</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; color: rgb(9, 0, 255);\">수</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(9, 0, 255);\">) ~ 03.31</span><span style=\"color: rgb(9, 0, 255);\">(</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; color: rgb(9, 0, 255);\">목</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; color: rgb(9, 0, 255);\">) 18:00 (모집기간 연장)</span></b></p><p class=\"0\">  <!--[if !supportEmptyParas]-->&nbsp;<!--[endif]-->  <o:p></o:p></p><p class=\"0\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">6) </span><span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-fareast-font-